<p class="article-lead">For roughly twenty years, I went by Nebukatneza in Azeroth. Then, in November 2026, I walked into the world with a different name above my head for the first time. It said <strong>Dennis Hilk</strong>. Two decades to come up with a new character name, and I went with the one I already had. The fellow wearing it is an undead paladin.</p>

<h2 id="observer">WoW Forever Observer</h2>
